WEBVTT

00:01.615 --> 00:02.952
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.976 --> 00:04.311
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.335 --> 00:07.551
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.575 --> 00:13.135
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.135 --> 01:31.095
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.255 --> 01:34.495
=Episode 20=

01:41.645 --> 01:42.645
This one is available.

01:45.695 --> 01:48.320
(Cuihua, swordswoman
of Sword Tomb of the Wu family)

01:55.295 --> 01:56.295
Here.

02:01.845 --> 02:02.845
Tastes great.

02:03.720 --> 02:04.357
Cuihua.

02:04.381 --> 02:04.951
Mm?

02:04.975 --> 02:06.455
Why does the pickled cabbage you made

02:06.645 --> 02:07.645
taste so good?

02:07.795 --> 02:08.795
Mm.

02:10.295 --> 02:11.295
However,

02:12.820 --> 02:14.046
there's always pickled cabbage.

02:14.070 --> 02:15.396
How about

02:15.420 --> 02:16.545
another kind of vegetable?

02:16.795 --> 02:18.075
I can only make pickled cabbage.

02:20.695 --> 02:21.935
That's brilliant enough.

02:23.045 --> 02:24.455
You keep eating every day.

02:25.470 --> 02:27.445
Didn't you say you would
bother Xu Fengnian?

02:32.545 --> 02:34.175
The senior around him is too strong.

02:34.345 --> 02:35.545
I'm afraid I can't defeat him.

02:35.595 --> 02:37.236
He scared you so quickly?

02:39.370 --> 02:40.370
Anyway,

02:41.720 --> 02:42.946
someone will try to hurt Xu Fengnian.

02:42.970 --> 02:44.014
I'm in no hurry.

02:56.020 --> 02:57.195
Who are you?

03:12.170 --> 03:13.170
Pull out your sword.

03:54.245 --> 03:55.645
Why didn't you pull out your sword?

03:56.145 --> 03:57.694
Haven't you heard about it?

03:57.895 --> 03:59.225
If I have the sword in my heart,

03:59.495 --> 04:00.574
even grass or stone

04:00.770 --> 04:02.495
can be used as a sword.

04:03.534 --> 04:04.574
Nonsense!

06:01.645 --> 06:02.645
What a waste!

06:04.170 --> 06:05.245
A sword is a sword.

06:05.295 --> 06:06.646
Grass is grass.

06:06.670 --> 06:08.146
Only ignorant people think
they're the same.

06:08.170 --> 06:09.170
Pull out your sword.

06:09.720 --> 06:10.720
Be patient.

06:10.945 --> 06:12.046
The sword is most threatening

06:12.070 --> 06:13.350
when it's still in the scabbard.

06:16.920 --> 06:18.335
She's your swordswoman?

06:18.670 --> 06:19.934
More than that.

06:20.520 --> 06:22.374
She makes delicious pickled cabbage.

06:23.645 --> 06:25.494
It's good luck
for Sword Tomb of the Wu family.

06:25.970 --> 06:26.986
In this generation,

06:27.010 --> 06:28.775
there are two gifted swordsmen.

06:29.795 --> 06:30.875
Will you keep fighting?

06:31.045 --> 06:32.045
No.

06:32.370 --> 06:33.611
Wasn't the fight

06:33.895 --> 06:35.494
a little bit ridiculous?

06:36.045 --> 06:37.695
They two are good.

06:38.020 --> 06:39.335
They're qualified.

06:45.320 --> 06:46.320
It's you?

06:47.095 --> 06:48.335
Here's another chance for you.

06:48.520 --> 06:49.472
Tomorrow afternoon,

06:49.496 --> 06:51.416
Xu Fengnian will go to the reeds
out of the town.

06:51.470 --> 06:52.995
By then, this man

06:53.245 --> 06:55.255
will fight Xu Fengnian with you.

06:57.145 --> 06:58.455
Who's he?

07:04.070 --> 07:05.195
I'm Wang Mingyin.

07:05.995 --> 07:08.445
Wang Mingyin,

07:08.695 --> 07:09.710
the No. 11 martial artist?

07:09.734 --> 07:11.145
(Wang Mingyin, the No.11 swordsman)

07:20.770 --> 07:22.371
Wang Mingyin is also in Xiangfan?

07:22.395 --> 07:22.973
Yes.

07:22.997 --> 07:24.570
Someone brought the message to the inn.

07:24.720 --> 07:25.830
The waiter passed it on to us.

07:25.854 --> 07:26.672
Who sent the message?

07:26.696 --> 07:27.976
A girl, according to the waiter.

07:28.255 --> 07:29.135
She smiled

07:29.270 --> 07:30.734
and left without telling her name.

07:31.020 --> 07:32.345
Do you know who she is?

07:34.220 --> 07:35.370
I don't.

07:38.220 --> 07:39.710
Who's Wang Mingyin?

07:39.734 --> 07:41.335
In the ranking of martial artists,

07:41.420 --> 07:44.494
(Wang Mingyin has arrived in Xiangfan.)
he's always No.11.

07:46.145 --> 07:48.421
But there are usually top ten masters.

07:48.445 --> 07:50.191
He's just No.11.

07:50.215 --> 07:51.974
He must be very depressing.

07:52.345 --> 07:53.510
In such a big world,

07:53.534 --> 07:55.015
he's already one of the best

07:55.745 --> 07:57.215
even though he's No.11.

07:57.820 --> 07:59.445
What does it concern you?

08:03.095 --> 08:04.534
He came to kill me, I guess.

08:06.420 --> 08:07.455
Why?

08:10.320 --> 08:11.135
Because...

08:11.270 --> 08:12.670
The Xu family is my enemy.

08:13.170 --> 08:14.170
How?

08:16.645 --> 08:17.655
Have you brought them?

08:17.820 --> 08:19.870
Lord of Jing'an asked me
to return them to you,

08:20.220 --> 08:21.645
as a token of his sincerity.

08:48.395 --> 08:49.494
In the box

08:50.120 --> 08:52.495
are the eyes
of my brother Wang Mingyang.

08:56.645 --> 08:58.345
Wang Mingyang?

08:59.470 --> 09:01.055
It sounds familiar.

09:01.870 --> 09:03.320
He used to be a famous general

09:03.370 --> 09:04.695
of West Chu.

09:04.895 --> 09:05.895
Oh, I remember.

09:07.134 --> 09:08.854
No.1 Defender Wang Mingyang.

09:09.335 --> 09:10.894
No.1 Defender.

09:11.470 --> 09:12.894
He's worthy of the title.

09:13.070 --> 09:14.575
When Xu Xiao besieged Xiangfan

09:15.145 --> 09:16.575
with 100 thousand soldiers,

09:16.895 --> 09:18.735
Wang Mingyang defended the town
for three years

09:18.895 --> 09:20.014
before it was broken into.

09:20.445 --> 09:21.695
I've heard about it.

09:22.734 --> 09:23.552
After the town was broken into,

09:23.576 --> 09:25.374
Wang Mingyang died in the battle.

09:25.614 --> 09:26.774
The fortunes of West Chu

09:26.920 --> 09:28.119
started to decline.

09:32.854 --> 09:35.215
So, Wang Mingyin wants to kill you,

09:35.670 --> 09:37.231
to avenge his brother?

09:39.570 --> 09:41.220
There's no personal grudge in a war.

09:41.320 --> 09:42.935
During battles,

09:43.014 --> 09:44.134
people die or live.

09:44.420 --> 09:45.920
But after that battle,

09:46.270 --> 09:47.455
I once said

09:47.945 --> 09:49.195
that no one from the Xu family

09:49.520 --> 09:51.845
could come to Xiangfan again.

09:52.670 --> 09:54.345
Now that Xu Fengnian has come,

09:54.695 --> 09:55.734
he can't leave!

09:57.420 --> 09:58.575
What happened

09:59.045 --> 10:00.134
to the eyes?

10:02.420 --> 10:03.520
Mr. Wang Mingyang

10:03.795 --> 10:04.974
dug out his eyes

10:05.320 --> 10:06.630
before he died,

10:06.654 --> 10:08.031
saying he would like to see

10:08.055 --> 10:09.096
how Xiangfan and West Chu

10:09.120 --> 10:10.911
would end up.

10:10.935 --> 10:12.175
After the battle,

10:12.420 --> 10:14.770
his body was burned in the fire.

10:15.095 --> 10:17.270
Only his eyes were kept.

10:18.420 --> 10:19.535
Lord of Jing'an

10:20.070 --> 10:21.535
always admired your brother.

10:21.770 --> 10:23.055
Since he commanded Qingzhou,

10:23.095 --> 10:25.734
he's been enshrining your brother, too.

10:25.895 --> 10:26.895
This time,

10:27.670 --> 10:29.445
he's returning the eyes to you

10:29.720 --> 10:30.720
so that

10:31.195 --> 10:32.590
he'll take a load off his mind.

10:32.614 --> 10:34.134
Even if he didn't return the eyes,

10:34.345 --> 10:35.721
I would kill Xu Fengnian, too!

10:35.745 --> 10:36.974
Of course.

10:37.745 --> 10:39.710
There are a lot of masters
around Xu Fengnian

10:39.734 --> 10:40.894
as well as the cavalry.

10:41.320 --> 10:42.417
I will

10:42.441 --> 10:43.614
help you, too.

10:44.770 --> 10:45.770
You?

10:46.495 --> 10:47.695
For your information,

10:48.320 --> 10:49.520
I've prepared

10:49.695 --> 10:50.695
some special tools.

10:55.095 --> 10:56.520
Fujiang Armor?

10:59.614 --> 11:00.614
Besides this,

11:00.820 --> 11:01.734
Lord of Jing'an

11:01.770 --> 11:03.571
will transfer some cavalrymen
for besiegement.

11:03.595 --> 11:05.470
Tomorrow, Xu Fengnian will die

11:06.970 --> 11:07.970
in the reeds.

11:18.395 --> 11:20.071
You know someone is going to kill you.

11:20.095 --> 11:21.415
Why are you still taking a troll?

11:22.295 --> 11:23.551
It's a famous ancient town.

11:23.575 --> 11:25.095
I should certainly take a look around.

11:26.195 --> 11:26.912
Don't worry.

11:26.936 --> 11:28.420
Even if they want to kill me,

11:28.570 --> 11:29.895
they won't do it today

11:30.320 --> 11:31.595
or in the town.

11:32.795 --> 11:34.445
You'd better be careful.

11:59.595 --> 12:00.595
Your Highness.

12:09.120 --> 12:10.145
Wen Hua!

12:12.095 --> 12:14.670
(Ranger Wen Hua)

12:18.345 --> 12:19.784
Xu.

12:20.295 --> 12:21.734
What were you doing here?

12:24.370 --> 12:25.935
Sleeping. Didn't you see?

12:28.145 --> 12:30.970
Who did you steal the clothes from?

12:31.945 --> 12:33.124
You even stole two blades.

12:34.445 --> 12:35.750
If the owner comes to you,

12:35.774 --> 12:36.870
don't get me in trouble.

12:37.195 --> 12:38.575
Come on.

12:38.854 --> 12:40.145
You still look untidy.

12:40.395 --> 12:41.596
You haven't been famous yet, have you?

12:41.620 --> 12:42.572
Don't talk nonsense.

12:42.596 --> 12:43.791
If you're a true friend,

12:43.815 --> 12:44.820
take off your clothes

12:44.895 --> 12:45.871
and exchange them for a meal

12:45.895 --> 12:47.175
so that we can have a good time.

12:48.845 --> 12:49.870
Go get us a meal.

12:57.170 --> 12:58.270
Where did you get her?

12:59.494 --> 13:00.432
I told you

13:00.456 --> 13:02.376
I was from an aristocratic family
of North Liang.

13:02.970 --> 13:03.970
I don't believe that.

13:21.045 --> 13:22.045
Enjoy it, please.

13:23.870 --> 13:25.335
Thank you, Mrs. Xu.

13:25.495 --> 13:27.230
Mr. Wen, you get it wrong.

13:27.254 --> 13:28.321
I'm a mere maid.

13:28.345 --> 13:29.695
You're a beautiful girl.

13:29.770 --> 13:32.175
It's ridiculous if you're only a maid.

13:33.545 --> 13:34.665
If he bullies you,

13:35.095 --> 13:35.911
tell me.

13:35.935 --> 13:37.215
I'll teach him a lesson for you.

13:40.720 --> 13:41.734
Seriously.

13:42.120 --> 13:43.470
Why did you come to Xiangfan?

13:45.320 --> 13:46.545
I had a crush on a girl.

13:47.220 --> 13:48.220
She's so beautiful...

13:49.545 --> 13:51.045
Again?

13:52.545 --> 13:54.071
What do you mean again?

13:54.095 --> 13:55.630
I indeed like her.

13:55.654 --> 13:56.814
You like every girl you meet.

13:57.620 --> 13:58.695
Forget it.

14:01.695 --> 14:02.545
Where's Old Huang?

14:02.670 --> 14:03.815
He hasn't come with you?

14:05.995 --> 14:07.134
He's gone.

14:10.620 --> 14:11.620
He's dead?

14:15.820 --> 14:16.820
Yes.

14:22.695 --> 14:23.695
Old Huang...

14:23.945 --> 14:25.014
He's a good man.

14:25.820 --> 14:27.134
I don't care about others.

14:27.455 --> 14:28.455
But I must go

14:28.545 --> 14:29.545
and see Old Huang's tomb.

14:29.770 --> 14:30.770
Where was he buried?

14:37.145 --> 14:38.645
He died near East Sea.

14:41.545 --> 14:42.545
There's no tomb for him.

14:48.520 --> 14:49.935
Why did he go too far?

14:50.695 --> 14:52.575
When I met you that year,

14:53.170 --> 14:55.175
Old Huang kept nagging.

14:55.495 --> 14:56.774
I found him so annoying.

14:57.645 --> 14:58.854
But when he's gone,

15:01.445 --> 15:02.935
I feel kind of lonely.

15:03.970 --> 15:05.395
I feel lonely, too.

15:19.220 --> 15:20.220
What are you doing?

15:20.445 --> 15:21.470
Look at you.

15:21.494 --> 15:23.295
Old Huang will think you disgrace him.

15:25.670 --> 15:26.721
Some people are born

15:26.745 --> 15:27.854
and some people are gone.

15:28.295 --> 15:29.935
This is the martial world.

15:32.395 --> 15:33.395
Cheers.

15:39.720 --> 15:41.345
If Old Huang were here,

15:42.120 --> 15:43.520
I wouldn't have the drumstick.

15:43.570 --> 15:45.134
Neither would I.

15:48.945 --> 15:50.521
- Forget about him!
- Forget about him!

15:50.545 --> 15:52.865
- Let's enjoy the drumsticks!
- Let's enjoy the drumsticks!

15:54.145 --> 15:55.270
If he were here,

15:55.520 --> 15:57.560
we wouldn't have
even a single piece of the chicken.

15:58.120 --> 15:59.145
Cheers.

16:00.670 --> 16:01.734
Remember!

16:01.895 --> 16:03.070
Some people are born.

16:03.245 --> 16:04.546
- Some people are gone.
- Some people are gone.

16:04.570 --> 16:05.571
This is

16:05.595 --> 16:07.195
- the martial world.
- The martial world.

16:20.070 --> 16:21.145
What's wrong?

16:26.220 --> 16:27.511
That's a good place.

16:27.535 --> 16:28.620
This is inappropriate.

16:29.845 --> 16:32.335
Stay away and don't look.

16:34.895 --> 16:35.745
It's inappropriate.

16:35.774 --> 16:36.774
Why is it?

16:38.045 --> 16:39.095
Xu.

16:39.370 --> 16:40.370
Xu!

16:43.595 --> 16:44.654
Sorry.

16:45.295 --> 16:46.974
I was a bit impolite.

16:51.175 --> 16:52.254
Let's go farther.

16:52.420 --> 16:53.700
Or she'll hear us.

16:57.095 --> 16:58.374
Old Huang is gone.

16:58.995 --> 17:00.315
Would you like to travel with me?

17:00.370 --> 17:01.710
I would like such a meal
from time to time.

17:01.734 --> 17:03.421
But if I have it every day,
life will be too happy.

17:03.445 --> 17:04.270
Anyway,

17:04.420 --> 17:05.232
if I always enjoy a happy life,

17:05.256 --> 17:06.776
I'll be in no mood for sword practice.

17:07.245 --> 17:09.694
Don't hold up my supreme swordplay.

17:10.470 --> 17:11.946
You only practice casually.

17:11.970 --> 17:13.050
What swordplay do you have?

17:17.545 --> 17:18.545
Come on.

17:19.395 --> 17:21.115
Leaves on your side are wider.

17:21.870 --> 17:22.870
Pick some for me.

17:25.420 --> 17:26.895
I want to use them myself.

17:27.920 --> 17:29.820
Don't be stingy, will you?

17:30.370 --> 17:31.654
Get some for me.

17:32.975 --> 17:34.295
Just use the thin leaves.

17:34.845 --> 17:35.845
How...?

17:37.895 --> 17:39.570
How can I just use them?

17:40.854 --> 17:42.255
I feel much better.

17:44.620 --> 17:45.620
It's getting late.

17:46.720 --> 17:47.934
I should leave.

17:48.370 --> 17:49.775
I owe you a meal.

17:50.595 --> 17:51.910
I'll repay you later.

17:51.934 --> 17:52.934
Where are you going?

17:53.395 --> 17:54.795
To the border of North Mang.

17:56.970 --> 17:58.410
There'll be chaos there, I'm afraid.

17:58.520 --> 17:59.520
Take care of yourself.

17:59.595 --> 18:00.770
How did you know?

18:01.145 --> 18:03.426
Are you really from
an aristocratic family of North Liang?

18:04.070 --> 18:05.032
I am.

18:05.056 --> 18:06.895
I don't care who you are.

18:07.820 --> 18:09.374
You're my buddy, anyway.

18:11.570 --> 18:12.695
We're good buddies.

18:12.945 --> 18:14.145
Chaos is good.

18:15.195 --> 18:16.195
We practice the sword

18:16.815 --> 18:17.815
in chaos,

18:18.245 --> 18:19.150
where we can sharpen the swordplay.

18:19.174 --> 18:20.174
Very well.

18:20.445 --> 18:23.374
Hope you'll obtain
the supreme swordplay soon.

18:24.370 --> 18:25.735
When I'm in trouble,

18:25.945 --> 18:26.945
I'll count on you.

18:27.245 --> 18:28.775
I simply owe you a meal.

18:29.695 --> 18:31.215
But I have to defend you with my life?

18:34.920 --> 18:35.920
All right.

18:35.995 --> 18:37.630
I'll say no more.

18:37.654 --> 18:38.654
I'm leaving.

18:40.620 --> 18:42.770
Don't know when we can meet again.

18:43.445 --> 18:44.995
The martial world isn't actually big.

18:47.795 --> 18:48.975
We will meet.

18:53.695 --> 18:56.095
- Steamed buns - Steamed buns

18:56.445 --> 18:59.570
- aren't as white as girls' hands.
- Aren't as white as girls' hands.

19:00.055 --> 19:02.335
- Tips of lotus leaves
- Tips of lotus leaves

19:02.654 --> 19:06.374
- aren't as curly as girls' eyelashes.
- Aren't as curly as girls' eyelashes.

19:08.170 --> 19:09.170
See you.

19:10.945 --> 19:12.575
The martial world isn't actually big.

19:12.695 --> 19:14.095
We will meet.

19:19.395 --> 19:21.271
Steamed buns

19:21.295 --> 19:23.031
aren't as white as girls' hands.

19:23.055 --> 19:24.454
Tips of lotus leaves

19:25.070 --> 19:27.894
aren't as curly as girls' eyelashes.

19:28.214 --> 19:29.695
What were you singing?

19:30.045 --> 19:31.535
The song we composed.

19:32.595 --> 19:33.295
Your Highness,

19:33.495 --> 19:34.551
you met Mr. Wen

19:34.575 --> 19:36.335
when you were traveling about?

19:36.735 --> 19:37.295
Yes.

19:37.570 --> 19:39.015
He had a trip with Old Huang and me.

19:39.270 --> 19:40.735
Looks like you think highly of him.

19:42.420 --> 19:44.134
According to Mr. Li,

19:44.520 --> 19:45.745
the patterns are used

19:46.015 --> 19:47.335
to transmit genuine spirit.

19:48.845 --> 19:50.420
The pattern inside the Armor

19:50.694 --> 19:51.745
is very complicated.

19:52.374 --> 19:53.374
I can't figure it out

19:54.020 --> 19:55.095
in a short time.

19:55.920 --> 19:57.360
You don't need to rebuild the Armor.

19:57.620 --> 19:58.791
See if you can find out its weak points.

19:58.815 --> 20:00.445
Seeing from this angle,

20:00.820 --> 20:02.214
we can try attacking

20:03.145 --> 20:04.454
from some points.

20:04.570 --> 20:05.575
Maybe,

20:06.214 --> 20:07.454
we can slow down the Armor

20:07.945 --> 20:09.055
for a couple of seconds.

20:09.920 --> 20:10.934
That's good.

20:11.020 --> 20:12.295
Your Highness, you think

20:12.770 --> 20:13.894
Fujiang Armor

20:14.295 --> 20:15.614
will appear tomorrow?

20:16.670 --> 20:18.255
If they want to kill me,

20:19.170 --> 20:20.620
tomorrow is a good chance.

20:34.570 --> 20:36.620
A gentleman doesn't go
to dangerous places.

20:38.020 --> 20:39.295
Now that

20:39.420 --> 20:40.535
you know it's dangerous,

20:40.820 --> 20:42.694
why not leave Qingzhou quickly

20:44.645 --> 20:45.645
and keep going east?

20:46.920 --> 20:47.934
I can't leave.

20:49.220 --> 20:51.311
Now that I let Wang Linquan
leave Qingzhou,

20:51.335 --> 20:53.295
Lord of Jing'an won't easily let me go.

20:54.120 --> 20:55.145
Your Highness,

20:55.645 --> 20:57.796
you've got your father's charm.

20:57.820 --> 20:59.174
I don't want to be like him.

21:02.970 --> 21:03.720
Grandpa Wei.

21:03.795 --> 21:04.397
Mm?

21:04.421 --> 21:06.775
If Fujiang Armor appears tomorrow,

21:07.445 --> 21:08.575
please try hard

21:08.745 --> 21:09.815
to deal with it.

21:16.870 --> 21:17.870
I will.

21:18.470 --> 21:19.471
I'll keep checking the pattern.

21:19.495 --> 21:20.495
Mm.

21:48.770 --> 21:49.770
Your Highness.

22:04.095 --> 22:05.615
You don't need to keep watch at night.

22:12.220 --> 22:13.620
Like I said,

22:14.095 --> 22:15.720
your mother and the Lin family

22:16.045 --> 22:17.895
have left Qingzhou with Uncle Wang.

22:18.720 --> 22:20.170
They're safe now.

22:23.970 --> 22:24.970
I know.

22:25.645 --> 22:27.205
Then why do you still stay in Xiangfan?

22:32.495 --> 22:33.630
I mean

22:33.654 --> 22:35.055
you don't need to follow me.

22:40.045 --> 22:40.791
Are you expelling me?

22:40.815 --> 22:41.815
I'm not.

22:43.245 --> 22:44.830
Xu Xiao kept you around me,

22:44.854 --> 22:47.020
taking you and your family as a chip.

22:47.620 --> 22:49.174
Now that I've let them go,

22:49.895 --> 22:51.220
you don't need to stay.

22:51.620 --> 22:53.020
You can go find Uncle Wang.

22:53.370 --> 22:54.730
He'll help you settle your family.

22:55.195 --> 22:57.174
But my mother said I was dead.

22:58.045 --> 22:59.735
I'm no longer one of the Lin family.

23:05.295 --> 23:07.095
Your mother is alive, after all.

23:08.945 --> 23:10.770
You don't need to stay around me.

23:37.845 --> 23:38.934
I assassinated you.

23:40.945 --> 23:42.015
I gave in to destiny, too.

23:44.945 --> 23:46.471
Everybody in the world says

23:46.495 --> 23:48.095
your family is
the traitor of our nation.

23:49.395 --> 23:51.720
But in the end, you and your father

23:53.470 --> 23:54.854
let us live.

23:59.195 --> 24:01.071
I don't know what is right

24:01.095 --> 24:02.195
or what is wrong.

24:02.795 --> 24:03.671
I also don't know

24:03.695 --> 24:05.374
the point of things

24:05.645 --> 24:06.894
I've ever done.

24:09.820 --> 24:11.295
But I promised you

24:15.470 --> 24:16.815
that I would protect you

24:17.645 --> 24:18.970
with my life.

24:19.345 --> 24:21.454
Even a loser like me

24:23.920 --> 24:26.245
wants to keep his promise.

24:28.495 --> 24:29.856
I'm not leaving.

25:28.320 --> 25:29.645
Why are you still here?

25:30.045 --> 25:31.846
Didn't I ask Ning Emei to take you away?

25:31.870 --> 25:33.015
Why must I leave?

25:34.870 --> 25:35.870
Listen to me.

25:35.995 --> 25:37.146
Tomorrow, in the reeds,

25:37.170 --> 25:38.171
we don't know what will happen.

25:38.195 --> 25:39.955
Let Ning Emei take you back
to Mushan Island.

25:40.214 --> 25:41.894
Yu Youwei and Fengzi Battalion
are there.

25:42.220 --> 25:43.350
You're going to leave me on the Island?

25:43.374 --> 25:44.390
No.

25:44.414 --> 25:45.791
I want you to leave Qingzhou

25:45.815 --> 25:47.295
and meet us later.

25:47.670 --> 25:49.270
What if it doesn't go smoothly tomorrow?

25:49.445 --> 25:50.272
If it doesn't,

25:50.296 --> 25:51.795
I'll probably die.

25:52.145 --> 25:53.596
You can then go away

25:53.620 --> 25:55.095
and be free.

25:56.470 --> 25:57.470
I'm not leaving.

25:57.995 --> 25:59.454
Why?

26:00.335 --> 26:01.894
Are you going to be in danger with me?

26:02.370 --> 26:04.174
If we have to be ruined tomorrow,

26:05.745 --> 26:07.134
I'll kill you personally.

26:08.545 --> 26:09.545
Xu Fengnian,

26:10.120 --> 26:11.535
when you have to die,

26:12.120 --> 26:13.694
no one can kill you, but me.

26:31.070 --> 26:32.070
All right.

26:33.820 --> 26:34.820
Sounds good.

26:36.370 --> 26:37.975
Don't be desperate.

26:41.270 --> 26:42.270
When I'm around,

26:42.370 --> 26:43.495
neither of you will die.

26:44.495 --> 26:45.970
How did you come in?

26:48.845 --> 26:49.934
When did you come in?

26:50.020 --> 26:51.271
When you were

26:51.295 --> 26:52.454
saying something romantic.

26:54.645 --> 26:56.445
Are you out of your mind?

26:57.820 --> 26:59.551
I said I would kill him.

26:59.575 --> 27:00.431
That wasn't romantic!

27:00.455 --> 27:02.520
That was harsh!

27:02.795 --> 27:03.910
What did you come for, senior?

27:03.934 --> 27:05.095
Go out with me for a stroll.

27:05.414 --> 27:06.346
For a stroll?

27:06.370 --> 27:07.171
You and me?

27:07.195 --> 27:08.195
Mm.

27:44.095 --> 27:45.775
What exactly are you doing?

27:49.170 --> 27:50.820
Before I left North Liang,

27:50.920 --> 27:52.745
Xu Xiao begged me for one thing.

27:53.770 --> 27:55.511
He said when there was no hope,

27:55.535 --> 27:56.846
as long as you asked me for help,

27:56.870 --> 27:59.220
I would take you back
to North Liang alone.

28:01.045 --> 28:02.095
Let me ask you now.

28:02.320 --> 28:03.400
Would you like to run away?

28:05.395 --> 28:06.395
What about the others?

28:07.270 --> 28:08.654
I have one arm left.

28:08.970 --> 28:10.614
I can't save a second person.

28:15.620 --> 28:16.620
Thank you, senior.

28:16.945 --> 28:17.831
But I don't want to run away.

28:17.855 --> 28:19.015
Think carefully about it.

28:19.170 --> 28:20.150
You only live once.

28:20.174 --> 28:21.534
Once you die, you're forever gone.

28:21.620 --> 28:22.620
I won't easily die.

28:25.295 --> 28:27.390
Do you remember Making Immortals Kneel?

28:27.414 --> 28:28.734
How would I possibly forget that?

29:01.545 --> 29:02.705
I've been trying it secretly,

29:03.070 --> 29:04.395
but I still can't use it.

29:05.070 --> 29:06.570
What's the essence of martial arts?

29:07.470 --> 29:08.470
Strength,

29:08.570 --> 29:09.255
speed,

29:09.520 --> 29:10.520
technique,

29:11.770 --> 29:12.770
and experience.

29:13.020 --> 29:14.170
Yes, at the beginning.

29:14.520 --> 29:16.095
But strength will be exhausted.

29:16.595 --> 29:18.046
When martial artists
get to the best level,

29:18.070 --> 29:20.214
their strength and speed
will reach the limit.

29:20.745 --> 29:21.910
Then they should mix the power of nature

29:21.934 --> 29:23.214
into their martial arts.

29:23.420 --> 29:25.694
At that time, temperament is decisive.

29:26.020 --> 29:27.374
Your obsessive thoughts

29:27.575 --> 29:28.855
will dominate your martial arts.

29:30.745 --> 29:32.430
Minds change martial arts?

29:32.454 --> 29:33.214
Wrong.

29:33.445 --> 29:35.595
Martial arts originate from minds.

30:17.995 --> 30:19.190
Making Immortals Kneel.

30:19.214 --> 30:20.335
What are immortals?

30:21.245 --> 30:22.245
They seek longevity

30:22.470 --> 30:23.255
and brilliance.

30:23.445 --> 30:24.575
They have vitality forever.

30:25.720 --> 30:27.214
It's the essence of immortals.

30:27.345 --> 30:28.345
What is vitality?

30:33.670 --> 30:34.552
Grass grows out of the ground

30:34.576 --> 30:35.590
against the laws of nature.

30:35.614 --> 30:36.815
This is vitality.

30:37.995 --> 30:39.454
There's vitality and death.

30:40.245 --> 30:41.430
If you want to be an immortal,

30:41.454 --> 30:42.894
you should keep the vitality only

30:43.070 --> 30:44.745
and remove the death!

30:45.270 --> 30:46.072
That year,

30:46.096 --> 30:47.751
when I created Making Immortals Kneel,

30:47.775 --> 30:49.134
I was very proud.

30:49.345 --> 30:50.934
Those mediocre men

30:50.975 --> 30:51.991
claimed to defy the laws of nature.

30:52.015 --> 30:52.871
They wanted to do that

30:52.895 --> 30:54.055
and become immortals.

30:54.445 --> 30:56.271
But I didn't want to associate

30:56.295 --> 30:57.495
with such losers!

30:58.470 --> 30:59.991
I created Making Immortals Kneel

31:00.015 --> 31:01.791
just to borrow the power of nature

31:01.815 --> 31:02.951
to oppress all mortal beings.

31:02.975 --> 31:05.150
I'd cut off the pride
and wild fancy of losers

31:05.174 --> 31:05.911
so that they would know

31:05.935 --> 31:07.311
there could be no immortals in the world

31:07.335 --> 31:08.795
as long as I lived!

31:14.995 --> 31:16.946
With Dahuangting in your body,

31:16.970 --> 31:17.991
you've got a foundation.

31:18.015 --> 31:18.871
Also,

31:18.895 --> 31:20.350
you're somewhat

31:20.374 --> 31:21.272
as proud

31:21.296 --> 31:22.735
as what I used to be.

31:23.045 --> 31:24.996
When you understand
the true meaning of the swordplay,

31:25.020 --> 31:26.374
maybe you can learn it.

31:26.870 --> 31:28.221
Is Making Immortals Kneel

31:28.245 --> 31:29.521
your strongest sword move?

31:29.545 --> 31:31.031
Every move of mine is the strongest.

31:31.055 --> 31:31.631
Right. Right.

31:31.655 --> 31:32.991
But speaking of my strongest move,

31:33.015 --> 31:33.870
it must be

31:33.894 --> 31:34.894
Snakes...

31:35.720 --> 31:36.720
In Sleeves.

32:33.695 --> 32:34.695
Hey.

32:35.195 --> 32:37.095
Who are we waiting for?

32:39.370 --> 32:40.670
Consort of Jing'an.

32:41.095 --> 32:43.421
You gave her a bracelet

32:43.445 --> 32:45.071
and your letter was like a love letter.

32:45.095 --> 32:46.311
She's Consort of Jing'an.

32:46.335 --> 32:47.775
Why would she come to see you?

32:48.095 --> 32:49.231
Even if she wants to,

32:49.255 --> 32:50.694
Lord of Jing'an won't agree.

32:51.120 --> 32:52.575
Just the opposite.

32:53.220 --> 32:54.694
She may not want to come.

32:55.870 --> 32:57.095
But Lord of Jing'an

32:57.345 --> 32:58.895
will make her.

33:50.245 --> 33:51.575
His Lordship ordered

33:51.695 --> 33:54.430
that Her Grace should
meet Xu Fengnian alone

33:54.454 --> 33:56.775
to see him off.

35:11.845 --> 35:12.570
Your Highness,

35:12.720 --> 35:13.710
I've arranged guards

35:13.734 --> 35:15.174
to escort Yu Youwei out of Qingzhou.

35:15.320 --> 35:17.015
The rest of Fengzi Battalion
have returned.

35:18.270 --> 35:19.396
Count heads.

35:19.420 --> 35:20.420
Yes.

35:42.645 --> 35:45.145
Fengzi Battalion has converged
with Xu Fengnian.

35:47.345 --> 35:48.895
Fengzi Battalion has arrived.

35:50.170 --> 35:51.810
What about the cavalry
of Lord of Jing'an?

35:53.120 --> 35:54.120
Senior,

35:54.795 --> 35:55.795
let's...

35:55.820 --> 35:56.820
Let's keep waiting.

36:01.345 --> 36:02.345
Your Highness,

36:02.545 --> 36:03.471
three soldiers are missing.

36:03.495 --> 36:04.122
Where were they missing?

36:04.146 --> 36:05.466
When we set out, they were there.

36:06.070 --> 36:07.870
They went missing in the reeds, I guess.

36:22.345 --> 36:23.431
I'll take some men to look for them.

36:23.455 --> 36:24.455
Wait.

36:24.495 --> 36:25.495
Your Highness,

36:25.570 --> 36:27.095
we can never abandon our companions!

36:27.595 --> 36:29.221
If you don't want more soldiers
to be hurt,

36:29.245 --> 36:30.245
listen to me.

36:32.595 --> 36:33.595
Here she comes.

36:59.870 --> 37:01.190
She indeed came.

37:04.220 --> 37:05.371
What's she doing?

37:05.395 --> 37:06.721
She isn't even taking a guard.

37:06.745 --> 37:07.745
Is she coming for a date?

37:08.795 --> 37:10.991
Why do you think Lord of Jing'an asked

37:11.015 --> 37:12.031
his favorite consort

37:12.055 --> 37:13.695
to see Xu Fengnian alone?

37:13.820 --> 37:14.820
You know the reason?

37:15.795 --> 37:17.120
I don't understand, either.

37:17.720 --> 37:19.790
I'm afraid no one knows
what Lord of Jing'an is thinking,

37:19.814 --> 37:21.734
but Xu Fengnian.

38:05.195 --> 38:07.214
Where's the bracelet I gave you?

38:07.720 --> 38:08.895
Why aren't you wearing it?

38:12.445 --> 38:13.695
Thank you, Your Highness.

38:14.020 --> 38:15.195
But I'd like to return it.

38:18.395 --> 38:20.575
Why are you returning it?

38:21.895 --> 38:22.895
You don't like it?

38:23.020 --> 38:24.370
Sorry, Your Highness.

38:24.670 --> 38:26.070
Let me throw it away, then.

38:27.820 --> 38:28.820
What does my uncle

38:29.420 --> 38:30.720
want you to tell me?

38:33.995 --> 38:35.334
This is his message for you.

38:40.620 --> 38:44.195
(See the nephew off.)

38:46.995 --> 38:47.995
We can no longer wait.

38:48.545 --> 38:49.920
Xu Fengnian is leaving.

38:53.620 --> 38:55.320
I'm afraid the Cavalry will not come.

38:56.945 --> 38:58.535
Shall we take action or retreat?

38:58.820 --> 39:00.055
Take action.

39:02.920 --> 39:04.695
There are too many masters around him.

39:08.895 --> 39:10.455
Lure them away.

39:23.745 --> 39:25.070
Give it back to me later.

39:26.620 --> 39:27.814
If I die,

39:28.945 --> 39:30.855
bury it outside Xiangfan.

39:42.045 --> 39:43.045
Here we go.

39:43.120 --> 39:44.120
Mr. Wu,

39:45.545 --> 39:46.614
don't you use your sword?

39:47.120 --> 39:48.195
The bamboo pole is handy.

40:05.695 --> 40:07.134
Crafty guy.

40:13.134 --> 40:14.595
See the nephew off.

40:15.145 --> 40:16.420
Only four words?

40:18.095 --> 40:19.495
What else did my uncle say?

40:19.970 --> 40:21.855
He asked me to give the message to you,

40:21.995 --> 40:23.420
without saying anything else.

40:24.045 --> 40:26.095
Maybe when he knew
you would leave Qingzhou,

40:26.495 --> 40:28.796
he wrote this to see you off.

40:28.820 --> 40:29.820
No, no.

40:32.245 --> 40:33.965
(See the nephew off.)
There are two meanings

40:34.095 --> 40:35.655
(See the nephew off.)
of the four words.

40:36.195 --> 40:37.795
But neither of them means seeing me off.

40:38.220 --> 40:39.375
Two meanings?

40:39.770 --> 40:41.210
The first one is easy to understand.

40:42.820 --> 40:44.134
Off means down,

40:44.320 --> 40:45.645
namely the hell.

40:46.395 --> 40:48.520
He wants to kill me.

40:50.134 --> 40:51.254
I've brought you the message

40:51.745 --> 40:52.895
and returned the bracelet.

40:53.295 --> 40:54.695
I won't bother you, Your Highness.

40:54.970 --> 40:56.134
I'll take my leave.

40:56.395 --> 40:58.035
Aunt, get off the carriage
and let's talk.

40:59.145 --> 41:00.296
Behave yourself, Your Highness.

41:00.320 --> 41:02.345
Do you think you can leave?

41:14.245 --> 41:15.895
Please get off the carriage, Aunt.

41:33.970 --> 41:35.070
Tell me.

41:35.470 --> 41:36.830
What would you like to talk about?

41:37.570 --> 41:38.570
Our soldiers.

41:41.370 --> 41:42.196
Go save them with me!

41:42.220 --> 41:43.055
Wait!

41:43.220 --> 41:44.072
What are we waiting for?

41:44.096 --> 41:45.110
They're soldiers of North Liang.

41:45.134 --> 41:46.294
You're disturbed already.

41:46.470 --> 41:47.110
Grandpa Wei!

41:47.134 --> 41:47.822
I'll go after them!

41:47.846 --> 41:48.871
Shu Xiu, Lyu Qiantang,

41:48.895 --> 41:49.895
follow him.

41:50.445 --> 41:51.595
Fengzi Battalion, follow up.

42:31.245 --> 42:33.174
Aunt, get onto this carriage.

42:33.455 --> 42:34.710
What exactly are you doing,
Your Highness?

42:34.734 --> 42:35.552
It's a dangerous place.

42:35.576 --> 42:36.820
I'm protecting you, of course.

42:36.970 --> 42:38.254
You're daring.

42:38.645 --> 42:40.654
You still hold her hands.

42:51.220 --> 42:52.375
I said,

42:52.995 --> 42:55.226
no one from the Xu family
can come to Xiangfan again!

42:55.250 --> 42:56.571
No.11 swordsman,

42:56.595 --> 42:58.145
Wang Mingyin.

43:29.875 --> 43:32.595
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.370 --> 43:37.170
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.095 --> 43:42.015
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.095 --> 43:46.895
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.195 --> 43:51.095
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.795 --> 43:55.615
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.620 --> 44:00.375
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.395 --> 44:05.320
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.820 --> 44:08.551
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.575 --> 44:09.815
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.595 --> 44:14.455
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.270 --> 44:17.996
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:18.020 --> 44:19.455
♪ The vanity ♪

44:19.945 --> 44:23.820
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.245 --> 44:25.596
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.620 --> 44:28.455
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.870 --> 44:31.351
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.375 --> 44:33.775
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.070 --> 44:36.096
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.120 --> 44:38.296
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.320 --> 44:42.535
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:42.895 --> 44:44.031
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.055 --> 44:47.095
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.270 --> 44:49.231
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.255 --> 44:51.975
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.535 --> 44:54.351
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.375 --> 44:56.871
♪ To start over ♪

44:56.895 --> 45:00.995
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
